          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्फूर्ति (sphūrti) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit sphūrti, \"quivering, throbbing\" (Monier-Williams); Hindi uses it for the lively energy one feels after rest, a sense the dictionary does not give. It is the learned cousin of phurtī."
